---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import studio from '../assets/studio.png';
import wild from '../assets/wild.png';
import { shop } from '../data/site';
import { path } from '../lib/paths';
---
<Layout title="Our story — Petal & Pine" description="Meet the idea behind Petal & Pine: garden-inspired flowers, thoughtful gestures, and a fictional Chester shop with a warm, natural spirit." image={studio}>
  <section class="inner-hero wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">The heart of Petal & Pine</p><h1>A little wild.<br />Always <em>thoughtful.</em></h1><p class="page-lead">A flower shop with a soft spot for the everyday. Inspired by the garden, by beautiful little imperfections, and by the people behind each gesture.</p></div><div class="inner-hero-photo"><Image src={studio} alt="Illustrative florist studio scene with loose flowers, linen ribbon, wrapping paper, and floral tools." widths={[640, 960, 1440]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 92vw, 45vw" format="webp" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section-space story-introduction"><p class="eyebrow">Flowers with feeling</p><h2>Not perfectly formal.<br /><em>Beautifully personal.</em></h2><div class="story-columns"><p>Some of the most meaningful gestures are the smallest. A bunch on the kitchen table. A thank-you left at the door. A colour that reminds you of someone. That is the feeling at the heart of Petal & Pine.</p><p>Our style makes room for texture, movement, and a touch of the unexpected. Soft petals sit beside wild greenery. A gentle palette can be just as expressive as a bright one. There is no single right way to make something lovely.</p></div></section>
  <section class="soft-band"><div class="wrap section-space"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Three things we come back to</p><h2>Rooted in <em>little details.</em></h2></div></div><div class="three-up"><article><Icon kind="flower" class="value-icon" /><h3>The person first</h3><p>A favourite shade, a shared memory, a small detail that says “this made me think of you”. Start there, and the gesture becomes yours.</p></article><article><Icon kind="flower" class="value-icon" /><h3>A garden state of mind</h3><p>Loose shapes, layered foliage, and flowers that have room to breathe. We take inspiration from the natural way things grow together.</p></article><article><Icon kind="flower" class="value-icon" /><h3>Everyday beauty</h3><p>You do not have to save flowers for a big day. A few stems can bring a little colour and care to the ordinary parts of life.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section-space split-section"><div class="editorial-photo arch"><Image src={wild} alt="Loosely gathered white flowers and greenery in a simple ceramic vase." widths={[640, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 92vw, 45vw" format="webp" loading="lazy" /></div><div><p class="eyebrow">A Chester-inspired little shop</p><h2>A place for a pause.<br /><em>A palette. A little chat.</em></h2><p class="body-copy">Picture flowers by the window, a little greenery on the worktable, and time to think about who the bouquet is for. That is the spirit of our sample Chester shop.</p><p class="body-copy">Our fictional address is {shop.address.join(', ')}. We are using example details while the site takes shape; the contact page brings them together in one place.</p><a class="text-link" href={path('contact')}>Explore the Chester shop preview <Icon /></a></div></section>
  <ContactCTA />
</Layout>
